      "content": "\"let go of the fight\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a scary way. like if there's nothing left of me to look at, then there's nothing left of me to hurt. if the person i was is already gone, what's even the point in staying? it's like i'm just a shell waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
